Z||000010||maryjane||10-07-2001||08:50 PM||||the nuke clock is a hypothetical. Usually called the Doomsday clock. The originator started in in the late 40's. The minute hand has been moved 15 or so times since then, one way or another. Describes how close we may be to worldwide thermonuclear war, based on a lot of variables. In any serious crises, it moves closer to midnight- in peace or during an event like the fall of the Soviet Union, it moves away from midnight.(h hour) I don't worry about it much. Kinda like worrying about large asteroid impact or the sun burning out. Nothing I can do about it.<p>[This message has been edited by maryjane (edited 10-07-2001).]||||reg||1
